#NEXUS

[ csiki2010a_fig6: Sauropod majority-rule consensus, panel A. The node letters A-D are keys to the caption (A Neosauropoda, B Titanosauriformes, C Somphospondyli, D Titanosauria), not printed clade names, so no internal labels are encoded. The diplodocoid branch leaves the Haplocanthosaurus line, and Nigersaurus, Rebbachisaurus and Rayososaurus leave one point (checked at 2x). 22 tips, 1 polytomies (3 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

